e=6AEB2F6F"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440 (2).png", "id": "818952757010626", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240098_818952763677292_337638963599190306_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JpEmSCxp4P0Q7kNvwFjY93c&_nc_oc=Adq7nGhOgAbuB-9qHKt3ngXGUEOj3UxIU7hOa8mp6tOlnRx9K3Jb0OHlbeeG2Lf7IX4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRjsTkmxjErMl7G3ZbadASwW4wFXpoeSmTt7pi84Z-b2w&oe=6AEB5AB4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 (2).png", "id": "1300838367963911", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974838_1300838371297244_1125909428722011491_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C4abmmrscjoQ7kNvwHIdO-U&_nc_oc=AdpeiHBOkGVY4_0UmyTqzd2JULeQkbJmvGLMBFs91eXPdzf51fQ1ExBdEKk_I0gFF8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTeO3swWEyxAyEr01c7n8uXBB1CWTFOv7CMAOQKivDiCQ&oe=6AEB344A"}, "display_name": "Interaction World Cube", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Cube control: Players can grab, move, rotate, and arrange cube blocks in 3D space, creating countless creative possibilities.\nFree movement: Explore the virtual world by moving freely in space, allowing players to approach every angle of the environment.\nDiverse worlds: Each world in the application has its own theme and challenges, ranging from simple to complex environments.\nEnvironmental interaction: Cube blocks can interact with elements in the environment, creating interesting effects and outcomes.\nIn-app purchases (IAP): Players can unlock additional new worlds through the in-app purchase system, expanding their gaming experience and exploration.\nVivid graphics: Sharp 3D images and bright colors create an engaging and vibrant VR world.", "short_description": "Interaction World Cube is an innovative and interactive virtual reality (VR) application designed to provide a unique experience for VR headset users. In this virtual world, players explore and 